<title>ESTONIA: SOCCER-SCOTLAND BEAT ESTONIA 1-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCOTLAND BEAT ESTONIA 1-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scotland beat Estonia 1-0</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in their European under-21 group four soccer</p>
<p>qualifier on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: JIm Hamilton (31st min)</p>
<p>Attendance: 500</p>
</text>
